  "description": "Minseo, betrayed by her adopted family, friends, and lover, loses her life and is reincarnated as Princess Helia of the Arsene Kingdom.\nIn her reincarnated world, she is stripped of her royal command through a plot and imprisoned in Daisy Palace.\nBut determined to no longer be subjected to this abuse, she steadily builds her power.\nShe establishes a merchant group, forges a connection with the Magic Tower, and expands her business. Eight years later, she reveals herself...\nThis is the story of Helia, who, with both money and power, becomes the Munchkin Empress, unifying the continent.  \n*(Google Translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=841530), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12964820) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004110)",
